      "contextBefore": ".avi",
      "contextAfter": "All Microsoft-defined “tombstone” data is transferred to the imported movie’s user data. Metadata fields that have QuickTime equivalents are mapped as follows: `'ICOP'` maps to `kUserDataTextCopyright`, `'ISBJ'` maps to `kUserDataTextInformation`, `'INAM'` maps to `kUserDataTextFullName`, `'ICRD'` maps to `'©day'`, `'IMED'` maps to `'©fmt'`, `'ISRC'` maps to `'©src'`. Where no QuickTime equivalent exists, the metadata item’s four-character code is modified by replacing the initial `I` with the symbol `©`. All other characters remain unchanged.",
